    &nbsp; Mrs. Aminath Azlifa was appointed as a Director of the board of directors on 9th June 2022 representing the public shareholders. Azlifa have education background in Information Technology (Diploma in Computer Software), Business Education (Diploma in Business Marketing), Marketing Qualification (Associate Degree in Business Marketing) and Management (Bachelor of BusinessAdministration).Aminath Azlifa, with over nineteen (19) years of management experience has worked at different agencies. These agencies include, former Ministry of Legal Reform and Information. Azlifa currently holds and is the Assistant Data Processing Officer of Maldives Media Council (MMC) and the ‘Information Officer’ of MMC, with the title and responsibilities assigned by Information Commissioners Office (ICom).&nbsp;&nbsp;
