                    <div class="col-xl-8 col-lg-6 align-self-center" id="profile-info">
                        
                        <h4 class="text-primary mb-2 text-center text-lg-start">Ibrahim Latheef</h4>
                        
                        <h6 class="text-secondary fw-normal text-center text-lg-start" id="designation">Director, Non-Executive</h6>

















                    

                            <p class="text-gray-500">
                                                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    &nbsp; Mr. Ibrahim Latheef was elected to the board representing the public on 2nd March 2023.&nbsp;Mr. Ibrahim Latheef holds a Master of Business Administration (MBA) from the Open University of Malaysia and did his&nbsp; BA (Hons) in Marketing from the University of Hertfordshire, Hertfordshire, United Kingdom. He is a chartered quality professional from CQI-IRCA and holds a Six Sigma Green Belt from the Six Sigma Management Institute. He was also a chartered marketer and a Fellow member of the chartered institute of marketing.Mr. Latheef is a General Manager of Maldives Transport and Contracting Company Plc and led various divisions, including Human Resources &amp; Administration, Transport and Logistical Operations.&nbsp;&nbsp;
    </div>
</div>
                                                            </p>

